#So xgUplane IP pair for PLMN1+SLICE1 select last pair: IPADDRESSV4-4/IPADDRESSV6-4
#For xgUplane IP addr, there is IP addr config in SNSSAI-2, so xgUplane IP pair for PLMN1+SLICE2 are: Null/IPADDRESSV6-5
